{"id":"e19221f4363bbadf","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-keyword-prefix-automaton.md","title":"有限关键词集合的前缀匹配自动机","display":"df-keyword-prefix-automaton — 有限关键词集合的前缀匹配自动机","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-keyword-prefix-automaton","aliases":["73-df-keyword-prefix-automaton"],"display":"df-keyword-prefix-automaton — 有限关键词集合的前缀匹配自动机","depends_on":["[[73-df-word-factors]]","[[73-df-dfa-structure]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§2.4, print pp. 65–68; PDF pp. 87–90; local prefix/suffix DFA construction","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":2},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-keyword-prefix-automaton"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-keyword-prefix-automaton</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-keyword-prefix-automaton — 有限关键词集合的前缀匹配自动机"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2a897e9cc590dbba\" href=\"?note=2a897e9cc590dbba\" title=\"73-df-word-factors\">73-df-word-factors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c0782b725f569c3a\" href=\"?note=c0782b725f569c3a\" title=\"73-df-dfa-structure\">73-df-dfa-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§2.4, print pp. 65–68; PDF pp. 87–90; local prefix/suffix DFA construction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq\\Sigma^+\">\\(K\\subseteq\\Sigma^+\\)</span> 是非空有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\\notin\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\top\\notin\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 是额外状态。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in Q_K\\setminus\\{\\top\\}\">\\(q\\in Q_K\\setminus\\{\\top\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\Sigma\">\\(a\\in\\Sigma\\)</span>。在最大元子句中，候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 是有限词；有限候选集中的同长度后缀至多一个。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_K\\coloneqq\\{v\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists k\\in K\\;\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^+\\;vu=k\\},\\quad Q_K\\coloneqq P_K\\cup\\{\\top\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_K\\coloneqq\\{v\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists k\\in K\\;\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^+\\;vu=k\\},\\quad Q_K\\coloneqq P_K\\cup\\{\\top\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B(q,a)\\coloneqq\\{v\\in P_K:\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;uv=qa\\},\\quad\n\\lambda(q,a)\\coloneqq\\iota v\\in B(q,a)\\;\\forall z\\in B(q,a)\\;|z|\\le|v|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B(q,a)\\coloneqq\\{v\\in P_K:\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;uv=qa\\},\\quad\n\\lambda(q,a)\\coloneqq\\iota v\\in B(q,a)\\;\\forall z\\in B(q,a)\\;|z|\\le|v|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_K(\\top,a)\\coloneqq\\top,\\qquad\n\\delta_K(q,a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\top,&amp;\\exists k\\in K\\;\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;uk=qa,\\\\\\lambda(q,a),&amp;\\neg\\exists k\\in K\\;\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;uk=qa,\\end{cases}\\quad\nA_K\\coloneqq(Q_K,\\Sigma,\\delta_K,\\varepsilon,\\{\\top\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_K(\\top,a)\\coloneqq\\top,\\qquad\n\\delta_K(q,a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\top,&amp;\\exists k\\in K\\;\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;uk=qa,\\\\\\lambda(q,a),&amp;\\neg\\exists k\\in K\\;\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;uk=qa,\\end{cases}\\quad\nA_K\\coloneqq(Q_K,\\Sigma,\\delta_K,\\varepsilon,\\{\\top\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>ε 是每个非空关键词的真前缀，故 B(q,a) 非空；其有限性及同长度后缀唯一性保证描述算子有唯一值。命中后进入吸收终态，记录“此前出现过关键词”，不只记录当前词的后缀。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-word-factors","status":"resolved","id":"2a897e9cc590dbba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-word-factors]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c0782b725f569c3a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-structure]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"K\\subseteq\\Sigma^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\top\\notin\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in Q_K\\setminus\\{\\top\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"P_K\\coloneqq\\{v\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists k\\in K\\;\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^+\\;vu=k\\},\\quad Q_K\\coloneqq P_K\\cup\\{\\top\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"B(q,a)\\coloneqq\\{v\\in P_K:\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;uv=qa\\},\\quad\n\\lambda(q,a)\\coloneqq\\iota v\\in B(q,a)\\;\\forall z\\in B(q,a)\\;|z|\\le|v|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta_K(\\top,a)\\coloneqq\\top,\\qquad\n\\delta_K(q,a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\top,&\\exists k\\in K\\;\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;uk=qa,\\\\\\lambda(q,a),&\\neg\\exists k\\in K\\;\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;uk=qa,\\end{cases}\\quad\nA_K\\coloneqq(Q_K,\\Sigma,\\delta_K,\\varepsilon,\\{\\top\\}).","display":true}],"bytes":1859,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-keyword-prefix-automaton|有限关键词集合的前缀匹配自动机]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"ac58a4b542040e38","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K,A_K,P_K,\\top$ 采用 [[73-df-keyword-prefix-automaton]]；$w\\in\\Sigma^*$。"}],"outgoing":["2a897e9cc590dbba","c0782b725f569c3a"]}